    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Greystones is delighted to present No. 23 Charlesland Wood to the market. This exceptional ground-floor, two-bedroom, own door apartment comes to market in \"walk-in\" condition, having undergone a substantial refurbishment in 2025.\nThe extensive upgrades include a new kitchen with modern cabinets, new integrated over, dishwasher and gas hob, contemporary tiling, and easy-care countertops, as well as a new Bosch gas boiler. All doors and windows have been replaced with high-quality PVC double-glazed units. The shower room now features contemporary wall and floor tiles, a large double shower with a recessed niche, and a luxurious rain shower head. The apartment has also been repainted throughout with new flooring added to the primary bedroom. Both bedrooms also feature floor to ceiling fitted wardrobes.\nThese modern enhancements ensure this property stands out within the Charlesland development and will undoubtedly appeal to the discerning purchaser.\nTo the front, the apartment features an outdoor entertainment space with composite decking that enjoys a sunny southerly aspect looking out onto a well-kept green space, ideal for al-fresco dining. Double doors lead directly into the living area, and the property further benefits from the use of a private hedged lawn which adds significantly to the appeal of the outdoor space.\nCharlesland is a mature development of apartments, duplexes, and houses positioned just over 2km from the heart of Greystones. The apartment is very convenient to an excellent selection of amenities including a SuperValu, pharmacy, cafe, and medical surgery. Public transport is a stone's throw away, with a creche and both primary and secondary schools located within 1km. The locality also boasts a superb variety of sports and leisure clubs, making it an ideal location for all ages.\nPersonal inspection is a must to appreciate the quality of this apartment.\nProperty Features\n• 2-Bedroom ground-floor apartment\n• South facing patio & garden \n• Convenient to shopping centre and public transport\n• Accommodation of approx. 66 Sq M\n• Own-door access with use of private hedged garden\n• Composite decked area with a south-facing aspect\n• New kitchen (c. 2025) with new integrated oven, gas hob and dishwasher\n• New Bosch gas boiler (c. 2025)\n• New doors and double-glazed windows (c. 2025)\n• Remodelled shower room (c. 2025)\n• Floor to ceiling fitted wardrobes in both bedrooms\n\n• Repainted with new blinds (c. 2025)\n• 2 storage closets\n• Semi-solid timber floor in living area and hallways\n• Annual service charge (including bins): 997.50\n• Managing agent: Schnittger Bourne\n• 2.3km to Greystones DART Station, seafront, and Main Street\n• 200m to SuperValu shopping centre and cafe\n• 700m to Greystones Community National School\n• 850m to Greystones Community Secondary School"
      },
